+appends `work-leaf: is this feature done? yes/no` to the patch-agent chat. A `yes` or `y` reply marks
+the feature closed without sending another backend prompt. A `no`, `n`, or any later follow-up input
+reopens the chat; non-yes/no follow-up text is then sent to the agent through the normal selected
+session message path after the reopened marker is appended.
